{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o133a","title":"王昶任司空","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o133a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"王昶任司空","evidence":["shaodi-e-o133a-q"]},{"id":"xuhuwang-a-e5d58f23fa6a015da6f5","label":"正文","text":"王昶迁司空持节都督如故","evidence":["xuhuwang-q-cb848837a4bacd7d791d"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0032","role":"受任","evidence":["shaodi-e-o133a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":258,"label":"甲戌","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y258","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o129","basis":"甲戌"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o133a-q","shaodi-q-o129","shaodi-q-b-ee7d999da8e03b038d07"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o133a-q","source_order":[4,580,"O133a"],"order":1201}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0032","name":"王昶","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o133a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-af667b138ffffa42f780","layer":"original","quote":"秋八月，甲戌〖23〗，以骠骑将军王昶为司空。丙寅〖24〗，诏曰：“夫养老兴教，三代所以树风化垂不朽也。必有三老、五更以崇至敬〖25〗，乞言纳诲〖26〗，著在惇史〖27〗；然后六合承流〖28〗，下观而化〖29〗。宜妙简德行〖30〗，以充其选。关内侯王祥〖31〗，履仁秉义，雅志淳固。关内侯郑小同，温恭孝友，率礼不忒〖32〗。其以祥为三老，小同为五更。”车驾亲率群司〖33〗，躬行古礼焉。﹝二﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":579,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":195},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-ee7d999da8e03b038d07","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ee7d999da8e03b038d07","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：甘露三年（公元 258）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":582,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-663d9ce877d00f2d0cbc","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"shaodi-q-o129","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b1abcd215d0c852fc17c","layer":"original","quote":"三年春二月〖1〗，大将军司马文王陷寿春城，斩诸葛诞。三月，诏曰：“古者克敌，收其尸以为京观〖2〗，所以惩昏逆而彰武功也。汉孝武元鼎中〖3〗，改桐乡为闻喜〖4〗，新乡为获嘉〖5〗，以著南越之亡〖6〗。大将军亲总六戎〖7〗，营据丘头〖8〗；内夷群凶〖9〗，外殄寇虏〖10〗；功济兆民，声振四海。克敌之地，宜有令名〖11〗：其改‘丘头’为‘武丘’。明以武平乱，后世不忘；亦京观、二邑之义也〖12〗”。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":575,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":197},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-cb848837a4bacd7d791d","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-4bc0503677ef81b58449","layer":"original","quote":"迁司空，持节、都督如故。","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":211,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":90,"end":102}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
